{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜騰訊混元：扎實小模型成本更低　預告下代參數規模顯著擴大           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">騰訊控股（00700）混元大模型團隊表示，基本功扎實的較小模型往往較大型模型表現更佳，成本亦更低，並預告下一代混元模型的參數量將顯著擴大，Hy4-mini及輕量級Flash-Lite已列入研發路線圖。團隊在開發者社區的問答活動中回應，Hy3及Hy4的表現已證明較小模型具成本優勢，同時仍信奉「規模定律」。團隊又重申會堅持開源路線，並著手改善模型寫作能力。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T21:04:19.325378+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T09:30:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T20:57:56.158519+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T20:57:56.158519+00:00","content_hash":"e69448f77c85ae71ddd8cd99f5c4dd2f75627853865ea0a13e9399f060d34509","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}